WEBVTT

00:00:17.833 --> 00:00:21.667
When I was little,
I had a younger twin sister,

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:24.333
and we lived in the forest
for the longest time.

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:36.375
Come on, Setsuna.

00:00:36.417 --> 00:00:38.250
Wait for me, Sis!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:40.750
Oh!

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:45.375
Setsuna, do you want this?

00:00:45.708 --> 00:00:47.625
Yeah! Thank you.

00:00:51.125 --> 00:00:52.333
Yummy!

00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:53.875
That's great.

00:00:54.458 --> 00:00:58.292
We were always together,
and we got along so well.

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.625
Setsuna, wake up.

00:01:15.542 --> 00:01:16.583
There's a fire.

00:01:17.708 --> 00:01:19.042
Setsuna, this way!

00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:20.458
Sis...

00:01:20.542 --> 00:01:22.375
It'll be okay. Just follow me.

00:01:22.708 --> 00:01:24.417
Come on, hurry up!

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:26.625
Then why, at that moment...

00:01:29.167 --> 00:01:31.875
...did I let go of her hand?

00:01:32.083 --> 00:01:34.292
Sis!

00:01:39.375 --> 00:01:41.375
Setsuna? Setsuna!

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:43.125
Sis...!

00:01:43.167 --> 00:01:46.375
Are you okay?
I'm sorry I ran off like that...

00:01:49.542 --> 00:01:50.875
Look out!

00:01:57.917 --> 00:01:58.667
Oh, no!

00:02:04.625 --> 00:02:05.417
Setsuna.

00:02:05.917 --> 00:02:06.917
Where'd she go?

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.250
I can't smell her anywhere.

00:02:10.292 --> 00:02:11.875
Sis!

00:02:11.917 --> 00:02:12.667
Setsuna!

00:02:13.167 --> 00:02:14.625
Setsuna!

00:02:14.667 --> 00:02:16.667
Sis!

00:02:17.167 --> 00:02:18.917
Where are you, Setsuna?

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.042
Setsuna!

00:02:34.167 --> 00:02:37.875
Setsuna!

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:21.125
THE THREE PRINCESSES

00:04:21.125 --> 00:04:22.708
"The Three Princesses."

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:30.417
HIGURASHI FAMILY'S CAT -
BUYO

00:04:30.792 --> 00:04:35.750
I realized later on that
I had been catapulted through time.

00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:39.250
Huh? Where am I?

00:04:45.708 --> 00:04:48.833
Hello, are you lost?

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:52.542
My name's Sota Higurashi.
What's your name?

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.000
Towa.

00:04:54.042 --> 00:04:55.750
Towa, huh?

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:03.083
I see.

00:05:04.792 --> 00:05:08.750
It looks like you've come
from a place far, far away, huh?

00:05:09.167 --> 00:05:14.208
I don't know why, but at that moment
I knew that I could trust this person.

00:05:15.042 --> 00:05:19.208
Please! Can you find Setsuna?
I'm looking for her!

00:05:19.625 --> 00:05:22.000
All right. Let's look for her together.

00:05:30.917 --> 00:05:36.042
Papa Sota helped me search,
but we never found Setsuna.

00:05:37.833 --> 00:05:41.917
It's been ten years since then.
Papa Sota ended up adopting me,

00:05:41.917 --> 00:05:42.292
HIGURASHI
SOTA
MOE
TOWA
MEI

00:05:42.292 --> 00:05:46.375
and as part of the Higurashi family,
I now go by "Towa Higurashi."

00:05:47.375 --> 00:05:49.583
My memories have faded over time.

00:05:49.625 --> 00:05:54.292
Lately, I've been thinking that maybe
that day was just a dream.

00:05:55.875 --> 00:05:59.708
But Setsuna was
definitely not a dream.

00:06:00.292 --> 00:06:02.042
That much, I know for sure.

00:06:03.167 --> 00:06:04.833
14 YEAR OLD GIRL - TOWA HIGURASHI

00:06:04.833 --> 00:06:06.208
Such nice weather.

00:06:06.792 --> 00:06:08.833
Time to brush my teeth.

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.333
I'm leaving now.

00:06:12.375 --> 00:06:13.583
Be safe.

00:06:16.375 --> 00:06:17.833
Good morning, Sis.

00:06:18.708 --> 00:06:19.833
Morning, Mei.

00:06:20.167 --> 00:06:22.292
It's your first day
at your new school, right?

00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:25.833
Don't get into any fights,
okay? I'm off!

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:28.417
All right, be safe.

00:06:28.542 --> 00:06:29.833
That's Mei.

00:06:30.125 --> 00:06:30.917
Papa Sota's true daughter.

00:06:30.917 --> 00:06:32.500
TOWA'S STEPSISTER - MEI HIGURASHI

00:06:32.500 --> 00:06:34.833
She's a bit shy and naive,

00:06:35.083 --> 00:06:39.417
but she's also cute, smart, honest,
and quite talented.

00:06:39.458 --> 00:06:40.833
She's my precious little sister.

00:06:42.125 --> 00:06:43.125
But...

00:06:43.833 --> 00:06:46.000
Maybe I cherish Mei so much because

00:06:46.583 --> 00:06:50.375
she's a substitute for Setsuna,
whom I never was able to find.

00:06:53.875 --> 00:06:53.917
I'm heading out.

00:06:53.917 --> 00:06:55.583
TOWA'S ADOPTIVE FATHER - SOTA HIGURASHI

00:06:55.583 --> 00:06:57.250
Be safe, okay? Wait...

00:06:57.917 --> 00:07:01.250
Towa! Are you going to school
dressed like a boy again?

00:07:01.333 --> 00:07:03.500
Why am I dressed like this, you ask?

00:07:03.542 --> 00:07:05.750
Because it's easier to fight in, of course.

00:07:06.417 --> 00:07:08.583
It's an all-girls school this time.

00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:11.083
We don't want you
getting into fights anymore...

00:07:11.125 --> 00:07:12.875
I know, I know.

00:07:13.625 --> 00:07:15.167
I'm off!

00:07:17.708 --> 00:07:19.375
Good grief.

00:07:19.583 --> 00:07:21.708
No one seems to get it.

00:07:22.083 --> 00:07:25.083
Transferring to an all-girls school
won't stop the fighting.

00:07:25.583 --> 00:07:29.417
The ones I take down
always come back for more.

00:07:32.833 --> 00:07:34.917
We found you, Higurashi.

00:07:34.917 --> 00:07:37.333
I heard you transferred schools again.

00:07:37.375 --> 00:07:39.792
You trying to run away from us?

00:07:39.833 --> 00:07:41.708
It won't be that easy!

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:42.917
Get ready!

00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:45.417
Who said I was running?

00:07:54.542 --> 00:07:59.667
Higurashi, don't get so full of yourself!

00:08:06.750 --> 00:08:10.333
Stop it! It'll break! Help!

00:08:16.917 --> 00:08:18.500
The fighting hasn't stopped

00:08:18.542 --> 00:08:22.083
ever since I stopped a bully
in elementary school.

00:08:22.625 --> 00:08:25.333
And there'd be more
each time I changed schools.

00:08:26.208 --> 00:08:27.583
They're all weak!

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:31.125
Why can't they just
keep their heads down?

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.500
That ain't no woman.

00:08:33.542 --> 00:08:35.583
Why doesn't she finish us off?

00:08:35.833 --> 00:08:37.958
She's too soft.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.583
But at this rate...

00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:42.083
We'll have to ask Bro for help.

00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:47.708
SAINT GABRIEL ACADEMY

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.750
My first day, and I'm late already.

00:08:51.542 --> 00:08:53.542
No one's looking, right?

00:08:53.917 --> 00:08:54.708
Okay.

00:08:54.792 --> 00:08:56.750
There we go.

00:09:00.292 --> 00:09:02.250
A demon slayer, huh?

00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:02.875
BOUNTY HUNTER - MOROHA

00:09:02.875 --> 00:09:04.875
There's actually a job for that?

00:09:05.375 --> 00:09:07.500
I had no idea.

00:09:08.375 --> 00:09:12.625
And? You're here to "slay" me,
Beniyasha?

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.833
Don't make me laugh.
Not happening in a million years!

00:09:16.875 --> 00:09:22.125
I'll turn you all into lunch
for my Kurikaramaru!

00:09:22.333 --> 00:09:23.708
Get ready!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.458
Moroha the Demon Killer!

00:09:26.542 --> 00:09:28.625
On behalf of the local villagers...

00:09:28.958 --> 00:09:31.125
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU - HISUI

00:09:31.125 --> 00:09:32.667
Hiraikotsu!

00:09:33.167 --> 00:09:34.167
Whoa!

00:09:37.208 --> 00:09:41.042
From the local villagers?
You've got the wrong target.

00:09:41.083 --> 00:09:46.083
I haven't left these mountains.
I'm just waiting for my bounty to show up.

00:09:46.125 --> 00:09:48.042
A demon <i>and</i> a bounty hunter?

00:09:48.208 --> 00:09:49.792
All the more reason, then!

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:51.042
Stand down, Hisui.

00:09:53.458 --> 00:09:55.042
Uncle Kohaku.

00:09:55.583 --> 00:09:56.292
Lady Moroha. Is another demon responsible
for attacking the local village, then?

00:09:56.292 --> 00:09:59.000
LEADER OF THE DEMON SLAYERS - KOHAKU

00:10:01.167 --> 00:10:02.542
Yeah, that's right.

00:10:03.042 --> 00:10:04.542
But it's too late.

00:10:05.125 --> 00:10:07.792
You've made me mad.

00:10:08.792 --> 00:10:13.750
With this rouge, I become Beniyasha,
Destroyer of Lands.

00:10:13.792 --> 00:10:16.500
Tremble before the bloodthirsty dawn.

00:10:19.792 --> 00:10:24.208
Hey, you demon slayers work with
an interesting companion.

00:10:24.458 --> 00:10:26.833
You're a half demon, right?
I'm also a...

00:10:26.833 --> 00:10:27.000
DEMON SLAYER - SETSUNA

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.917
Silence! You're dead.

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:33.792
Kanemitsu no Tomoe, huh?

00:10:33.833 --> 00:10:35.750
Fancy naginata you got there.

00:10:36.292 --> 00:10:39.250
Say, if I win this match, can I have it?

00:10:40.125 --> 00:10:41.750
Setsuna, I'll back you up.

00:10:42.583 --> 00:10:43.750
There's no need.

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:46.625
So your name's Setsuna, huh?

00:10:46.958 --> 00:10:52.417
All right! Sorry "Setsu,"
but I'll be taking your weapon!

00:10:55.417 --> 00:10:58.417
What? You saw through that?

00:10:58.917 --> 00:11:01.500
Not bad at all, Setsu!

00:11:05.208 --> 00:11:06.292
Wait, is that a...

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:11.917
You have a Rainbow Pearl, too?

00:11:12.417 --> 00:11:14.083
A Rainbow Pearl?

00:11:17.458 --> 00:11:19.917
The Rainbow Pearls! Hand them over!

00:11:19.917 --> 00:11:22.917
CENTIPEDE DEMON -
MISTRESS THREE-EYES

00:11:26.083 --> 00:11:28.292
So that's the one attacking the village...

00:11:28.708 --> 00:11:30.375
Retreat!

00:11:30.917 --> 00:11:35.167
Give it to me! Give me the Rainbow Pearls!

00:11:35.458 --> 00:11:36.875
Setsuna!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.792
Setsuna! Are you okay?

00:11:41.833 --> 00:11:43.667
CAT DEMON - KIRARA

00:11:44.750 --> 00:11:46.042
Mistress Three-Eyes!

00:11:46.542 --> 00:11:48.667
I knew you'd show up.

00:11:49.333 --> 00:11:51.417
Since I have <i>this </i>with me!

00:11:52.792 --> 00:11:54.417
The Red Pearl!

00:11:54.833 --> 00:11:57.542
I've been after you from the start.

00:11:58.042 --> 00:12:00.125
Time to claim my bounty!

00:12:02.333 --> 00:12:05.792
You're tougher than I thought!
In that case...

00:12:10.583 --> 00:12:11.875
Hey, demon slayers!

00:12:12.292 --> 00:12:15.000
Get lost, unless you want to
get caught in the crossfire!

00:12:15.375 --> 00:12:16.042
What?

00:12:16.083 --> 00:12:17.500
This way, Hisui.

00:12:17.542 --> 00:12:18.333
Yes, sir.

00:12:18.750 --> 00:12:21.292
Take this! Heavenly Arrow Barrage!

00:12:24.500 --> 00:12:26.208
You missed!

00:12:32.042 --> 00:12:34.000
Are those Sacred Arrows?

00:12:34.167 --> 00:12:36.167
No, those are the Arrows of Sealing.

00:12:36.208 --> 00:12:39.042
How could Beniyasha
have such spiritual power?

00:12:39.333 --> 00:12:40.792
I did it!

00:12:45.708 --> 00:12:48.500
H-Hey, get back here!

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:58.417
Give it to me.

00:12:59.167 --> 00:13:02.875
I need the other Rainbow Pearl!

00:13:03.875 --> 00:13:05.750
There it is!

00:13:05.792 --> 00:13:06.667
Oh, no.

00:13:06.708 --> 00:13:10.417
Hisui, divert Mistress Three-Eyes
to Lady Kaede.

00:13:10.458 --> 00:13:11.500
Yes, Uncle.

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:14.500
Come back here!

00:13:14.792 --> 00:13:18.625
Damn you!
Give me back my Red Pearl!

00:13:20.792 --> 00:13:23.000
– Thank you.
– There's a British proverb that goes like this.

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:23.750
– How'd it go?
– There's a British proverb that goes like this.

00:13:24.250 --> 00:13:27.500
"When in Rome,
do as the Romans do."

00:13:27.833 --> 00:13:28.125
TOWA'S HOMEROOM TEACHER -
OSAMU KIRIN

00:13:28.125 --> 00:13:32.208
When you're in an unfamiliar place,
you should behave like the people there.

00:13:32.250 --> 00:13:33.208
Right...

00:13:33.458 --> 00:13:37.375
I guess I won't be staying too long
at this school, either.

00:13:37.583 --> 00:13:39.792
If you'll be attending this academy,

00:13:39.833 --> 00:13:42.667
you should conduct yourself
like the students here.

00:13:43.083 --> 00:13:45.917
Being tardy because you got into
a fight is preposterous.

00:13:46.125 --> 00:13:48.667
I guess he's going to call my parents.

00:13:49.708 --> 00:13:53.542
I will overlook this for today,
but please be careful next time.

00:13:53.792 --> 00:13:54.375
Huh?

00:13:55.125 --> 00:13:57.375
That will be all.
You may go home now.

00:13:57.458 --> 00:13:58.708
What?!

00:13:59.792 --> 00:14:01.708
See you tomorrow, Mei.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.208
Okay, bye-bye!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:04.792
Bye-bye!

00:14:14.833 --> 00:14:18.417
This is the moment
when I feel at peace.

00:14:21.333 --> 00:14:24.000
The celebrated sword Kikujumonji,
a national treasure.

00:14:24.667 --> 00:14:28.042
I'm told that it once belonged
to the shogun Yoshiteru Ashikaga...

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:32.625
It's Mei. She's crying.

00:14:33.167 --> 00:14:34.875
She's at Grandpa's shrine!

00:14:37.417 --> 00:14:42.875
Your sister should be here soon.
So just sit tight.

00:14:43.792 --> 00:14:47.375
H-Hey, Bro.
Don't you think this is a bit much?

00:14:47.708 --> 00:14:48.917
You idiots.

00:14:48.958 --> 00:14:51.875
If you want to take revenge,
you gotta go big or go home.

00:14:52.208 --> 00:14:54.708
Don't be backing out on me now!

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:55.833
Yes, sir!

00:14:56.125 --> 00:14:58.875
This world is full of the weak.

00:14:59.125 --> 00:14:59.458
And because they're weak,

00:14:59.458 --> 00:15:00.875
MEI'S
GREAT-GRANDFATHER -
GRANDPA
MEI'S
GRANDMOTHER -
GRAMMY

00:15:00.875 --> 00:15:04.542
they band together and
pick on people weaker then them.

00:15:05.042 --> 00:15:06.542
I'm really sick of it.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:11.875
Well, aren't you guys lucky.
You get to see her crying face.

00:15:11.917 --> 00:15:15.042
You want to see it that badly?

00:15:15.583 --> 00:15:16.500
Sis!

00:15:16.917 --> 00:15:19.292
Mei! Grammy, Grandpa...

00:15:19.542 --> 00:15:22.042
I can show you a crying face.

00:15:22.417 --> 00:15:25.417
But it won't be mine. It'll be yours!

00:15:27.500 --> 00:15:28.292
Get her!

00:15:38.125 --> 00:15:39.792
You're pretty good.

00:15:40.208 --> 00:15:43.417
But I don't think you
understand the situation. Hey!

00:15:48.667 --> 00:15:49.667
Mei!

00:15:50.917 --> 00:15:55.333
I hope you haven't forgotten
that we have a hostage on our side.

00:15:57.292 --> 00:15:59.333
If that's how you
want to play this...

00:16:00.167 --> 00:16:02.083
Hey, what the hell is that?

00:16:02.375 --> 00:16:05.667
No one gives a shit if
that katana is real or not.

00:16:05.708 --> 00:16:08.125
Here's what'll happen
if you move even one step.

00:16:09.458 --> 00:16:14.125
Wouldn't want scars on your
cute sister's face, now, would you?

00:16:14.458 --> 00:16:15.875
Don't you dare move, got it?

00:16:15.917 --> 00:16:18.125
What's the matter, huh?

00:16:18.417 --> 00:16:22.583
Where's all that energy
from before, huh?

00:16:25.667 --> 00:16:29.542
Towa, you can't use your powers
in front of other people, okay?

00:16:30.125 --> 00:16:33.208
It's our little secret. Promise?

00:16:33.792 --> 00:16:35.417
Yeah! I promise!

00:16:37.125 --> 00:16:39.208
I'm sorry, Papa Sota.

00:16:40.083 --> 00:16:42.667
I can't keep our promise.

00:16:45.375 --> 00:16:46.167
What?!

00:16:53.917 --> 00:16:55.583
Please get somewhere safe.

00:16:55.625 --> 00:16:57.500
Please don't fight, Towa.

00:16:57.542 --> 00:16:59.458
I'll end it quickly.

00:16:59.500 --> 00:17:00.417
Sis!

00:17:00.667 --> 00:17:01.917
What the hell?

00:17:01.958 --> 00:17:03.083
She's not human.

00:17:03.125 --> 00:17:05.125
We're no match for that!

00:17:05.167 --> 00:17:06.792
Hey, get back here!

00:17:07.375 --> 00:17:08.875
What is she?!

00:17:08.917 --> 00:17:10.333
Come on Mei, let's go.

00:17:10.667 --> 00:17:12.875
Please stop fighting, Sis.

00:17:12.917 --> 00:17:16.875
Don't worry! I got this.
Your big sister's pretty strong.

00:17:16.917 --> 00:17:19.708
No! You can't!

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:23.625
If you keep doing things like this,
you'll never stop fighting.

00:17:23.667 --> 00:17:27.833
I know you really want to be
more girly and cute, don't you?

00:17:29.125 --> 00:17:33.833
Um, I guess there's a part of me that
can't answer immediately.

00:17:34.417 --> 00:17:37.333
You're supposed to say "yes,"
even if you don't mean it!

00:17:37.375 --> 00:17:39.167
Sorry. I'm sorry, Mei.

00:17:39.208 --> 00:17:42.125
Sis, you dummy!

00:17:45.375 --> 00:17:46.500
Bro!

00:17:46.542 --> 00:17:48.458
Who called the cops?!

00:17:48.500 --> 00:17:50.125
We'd better bail.

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.667
Looks like they were
only passing by.

00:17:58.708 --> 00:18:00.292
Well then...

00:18:00.458 --> 00:18:04.583
You dummy! You said
you'd never get into fights again!

00:18:04.625 --> 00:18:06.625
Sorry, Mei.

00:18:07.833 --> 00:18:09.875
Living in this world is hard.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:14.208
If you don't follow the set rules,
you're treated as an outcast.

00:18:14.542 --> 00:18:18.625
Girls must be feminine,
and boys must be masculine.

00:18:19.292 --> 00:18:22.833
I've just been so sick of that.

00:18:23.500 --> 00:18:26.542
But I think it's time
I stop being stubborn.

00:18:26.917 --> 00:18:31.583
There's nothing that could ever justify
making Mei cry this much.

00:18:33.917 --> 00:18:35.125
This smell...

00:18:35.167 --> 00:18:39.250
How strange. It's nostalgic,
one I've smelled before.

00:18:40.208 --> 00:18:43.000
By why is it coming from here?

00:18:49.083 --> 00:18:50.708
VILLAGE ELDER PRIESTESS - KAEDE

00:18:50.833 --> 00:18:52.833
Give me the pearl!

00:18:52.875 --> 00:18:55.000
I think we've come far enough.

00:18:55.125 --> 00:18:57.208
Hisui, I'll get off here.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:58.500
Are you serious?

00:18:58.542 --> 00:19:02.375
It's after the pearl in my right eye.
I'll use that to my advantage.

00:19:02.417 --> 00:19:03.250
Setsuna!

00:19:03.292 --> 00:19:05.542
I won't let you get away!

00:19:07.833 --> 00:19:10.750
Take this! Cyclone Burst!

00:19:17.542 --> 00:19:19.417
How dare you!

00:19:19.625 --> 00:19:21.417
My name is Setsuna.

00:19:21.458 --> 00:19:25.542
Those are my only words for you.
That is why you will die tonight.

00:19:27.083 --> 00:19:28.208
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:19:30.167 --> 00:19:31.792
What? You...

00:19:31.833 --> 00:19:33.542
Sorry, Setsuna.

00:19:33.583 --> 00:19:36.625
But I had first dibs on that one.

00:19:36.667 --> 00:19:37.875
– Ridiculous.
– Wha...

00:19:40.625 --> 00:19:41.250
Damn it.

00:19:41.375 --> 00:19:44.750
Come to me, Gold Pearl.

00:19:55.708 --> 00:19:57.667
Oh, what joy.

00:19:58.125 --> 00:20:00.417
It absorbed the Gold Pearl, too!

00:20:00.625 --> 00:20:05.417
The Rainbow Pearl's demon power
is becoming one with my own...

00:20:09.333 --> 00:20:11.167
What power...!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:16.792
Absorbing the Red and Gold Rainbow Pearls
has made it even stronger!

00:20:17.167 --> 00:20:20.542
Hold on. I've got you, Setsu!

00:20:20.583 --> 00:20:21.792
Don't call me that!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:29.833
I sense the Rainbow Pearl for the first time
in over ten years! And two at that!

00:20:30.167 --> 00:20:35.250
By the power of the Tree of Ages,
I now return to this world!

00:20:35.292 --> 00:20:36.292
What?

00:20:38.292 --> 00:20:40.250
What is happening?

00:20:53.708 --> 00:20:54.750
What is...

00:20:54.792 --> 00:20:55.833
Sis.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:20:57.375
This smell.

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:59.167
Mei!

00:21:03.833 --> 00:21:05.833
Oh, how strange.

00:21:05.917 --> 00:21:07.833
Sis, what is that?

00:21:08.417 --> 00:21:10.583
Could this smell be...

00:21:21.917 --> 00:21:23.917
– Wha...
– Oh, dear!

00:21:24.208 --> 00:21:26.250
That's... That's...

00:21:26.917 --> 00:21:30.708
Yes! That unbelievably bright place
from my memories...

00:21:30.917 --> 00:21:33.000
And this smell!

00:21:34.333 --> 00:21:35.583
Setsuna!

00:21:35.708 --> 00:21:38.250
Wh-Who calls my name?

00:21:38.333 --> 00:21:41.708
Damn it. I feel so weak.

00:21:41.875 --> 00:21:44.542
Is it because I crossed through
the rainbow corridor?

00:21:46.583 --> 00:21:50.625
Wonderful, just so wonderful!

00:21:50.667 --> 00:21:53.792
The Silver Pearl is here as well.

00:21:53.833 --> 00:21:57.708
Now each of my three eyes
will have a pearl!

00:21:58.042 --> 00:22:00.625
Setsuna, I'll save you!

00:22:08.125 --> 00:22:12.875
No way!
My Kikujumonji broke!

00:23:42.917 --> 00:23:43.750
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:43.750 --> 00:23:45.583
Setsuna shows up in the present day,

00:23:45.625 --> 00:23:48.333
but she doesn't remember
that I'm her older sister.

00:23:48.375 --> 00:23:51.583
I don't know you. If you value your life,
don't come near me.

00:23:51.625 --> 00:23:53.667
It's a nasty curse.

00:23:53.708 --> 00:23:57.208
The butterfly that lives in the Dream World
came out to this world,

00:23:57.250 --> 00:24:02.042
and you can't fall asleep ever again,
let alone have dreams.

00:24:02.083 --> 00:24:04.333
My dreams were eaten?

00:24:04.417 --> 00:24:07.292
Next time on <i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon:</i>
"The Dream Butterfly"

00:24:07.333 --> 00:24:11.708
It was because of me.
I'm sorry, it's all my fault.
